---
title: "All Posts"
description: "The LocalFTW archive, week by week — local LLM hardware, models, quantisation and tooling, from February 2026 onwards."
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /posts/
---

<h1>All Posts</h1>

<p class="submit-link">Have something to share? <a href="/contribute/">Submit a post</a></p>

<p class="archive-intro">The archive is organised by week. Each week has its own page carrying that week's summary and every post published in it.</p>

<ul class="post-list week-index">
{%- for week in collections.weekPages %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ week.url }}">{{ week.title }}</a>
    <time datetime="{{ week.weekKey }}">{{ week.postCount }} post{{ "s" if week.postCount != 1 }}</time>
    {%- set ws = summaries.weekly[week.weekKey] %}
    {%- set wsText = (ws.text if ws.text else ws) if ws else "" %}
    <p class="summary">{% if wsText %}{{ wsText | striptags | truncate(220) }}{% else %}{{ week.description }}{% endif %}</p>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
